    v_quiz_id, 'single', 'What type of critical point is the origin (0, 0) for the function f(x, y) = x^2 - y^2?', 'f_x = 2x, f_y = -2y -> (0,0) is critical. r = 2, s = 0, t = -2. rt - s^2 = (2)(-2) - 0 = -4 < 0 => Saddle point.',
